title: Employee1_Act1
---
Company Employee: Hello! Skier! 
Company Employee: Have you been informed about the company yet?
-> Yea...
    Company Employee: So you know our plans!
    Company Employee: I can't wait to see what happens to the resort.
    Company Employee: Maybe they'll give me an employee discount.
    Company Employee: ...
    Company Employee: Maybe they'll give me a promotion!
-> No?
    Company Employee: You should be sure to familiarize yourself.
    Company Employee: We're in the process of acquiring this mountain.
    -> Acquire the mountain?
        Company Employee: Yes! The mountain will be so much better afterwards.
        Company Employee: I mean lift tickets might get more expensive, but that's not important...
        Company Employee: If you dont mind, can you fill out this review for me?
        Company Employee: If you fill it out, I'm one step closer to that promotion!
        -> Hell no!
            Company Employee: Well whatever! I'm sure I can get other people to review me!
        -> Uh, sure.
            Company Employee: Thank you! I love you!
===

title: Employee1_Act2
---
Company Employee: Hello! Skier! Again!
-> What are you looking at?
    Company Employee: Me? I'm just looking at the scenery.
    Company Employee: Did you know there's a lake nearby?
    Company Employee: The Company wants to make these big artificial snow generators.
    Company Employee: It'll make the skiing season last longer.
    Company Employee: I wonder if they'll use the lake for the water.
-> ...
Company Employee: ... 
Company Employee: Would you be willing to fill out my employee review?
-> No.
    Company Employee: ... darn.
-> I will... later.
    Company Employee: I look forward to it! I love you!
===

title: Employee1_Act3
---
Company Employee: So you're trying to stop us?
Company Employee: Ha! Good luck! I've got my promotion in the bag!
Company Employee: I've seen the designs the graphic design team has been doing.
Company Employee: This place is about to get a whole lot livelier if I have anything to say about it!
Company Employee: ...
Company Employee: Would you be willing to fill out my employee review?
-> NO!
    Company Employee: WHO CARES!
    Company Employee: I DON'T WANT YOU TO DO MY EMPLOYEE REVIEW ANYWAY!
-> FINE!
    Company Employee: THANK YOU THEN! I LOVE YOU!
===

title: Employee1_Act4
---
Company Employee: ...
Company Employee: Sigh...
Company Employee: Yeah, whatever, you won...
Company Employee: My promotion is down the drain. Happy?
Company Employee: ... 
Company Employee: Would you fill out my employee review? For old times sake?
-> No. 
    Company Employee: Worth a shot, I guess.
-> Sure, why not.
    Company Employee: Thank you! I love you!
===